Hello players, long time no see!
We’ve recently pushed a new installation package, mainly focused on fixing bugs that were affecting your gameplay experience. This includes adjustments to the "That Building" NPC's bad ending trigger conditions and optimization of the green lines appearing on some maps.

For detailed updates, please check the log below~

【Fixes】

 Fixed various typos;
 Fixed an issue where players could still interact with Su Yizhan while poisoned;
 Fixed errors when reviewing Sifangjue’s side story in the exhibition room;
 Fixed a bug allowing reward farming from the Mo Yuebai (green outfit) line after disconnection;
 Fixed an issue where certain story checkpoints failed to proceed properly due to save comment prompts;
 Fixed a collision bug when encountering the Xizhou City festival setup while intoxicated;
 Fixed the trigger condition for Jinse's bad ending: if you spend money to rescue the NPC during the prologue questionnaire, the bad ending will no longer trigger later;
 Fixed story continuation position errors when loading from a saved file;
 Fixed an issue where interactions with Mo Ying could still trigger unrelated dialogue states while traveling with a romance companion;
 Fixed a bug preventing mount summoning after successfully inviting a romance companion to celebrate a festival;

【Optimizations】

 Optimized battle maps to allow direct collection of map material items;
 Optimized the issue of green lines appearing at the edges of some maps.


