Hello everyone,

We recently released a new update package, mainly adding new features and fixing bugs that affected your gameplay experience. New content includes the Undersea Maze, the second floor of the Changming Village Underground Palace, and more.

Some players may be unable to access the game update page. If this happens, please manually log out of Steam and log back in. We sincerely apologize for the inconvenience!

[New Content]

 Added Changming Village Underground Palace Second Floor - can obtain a large number of game coins;
 Added Undersea Maze - can mainly obtain white shells;
 Added companion reactions when interacting with the rat hole in the [Ruins Temple];
 Added feedback when Su Li and Jiu Xi are walking together;
 Added the official avatar of the character [Qiu Ye] in the fourth chapter of the main storyline;
 Attachment: The facial changes have not yet been added to the playback part of the exhibition room;
 Added the batch identification function of [antique] items.

[Bug Fixes]

 Fixed a bug where the player character's eye color did not change when entering a berserk state;
 Fixed the issue where the "Leave" option was missing in the playback menu of some characters in the showroom;
 Fixed a bug where the upper right corner text UI occasionally disappeared;
 Fixed a bug where Qi Yang and Xi Xin could only be teased three times a day;
 Fixed an issue where the dialog box that popped up after completing the "Snow Spirit Clothes" quest would remain on the map;
 Fixed an issue where Mo Ying's image would not disappear after being recruited;
 Fixed an issue where the recipe price was inconsistent with the database settings;
 Fixed an issue where the new save inherited the summoning scroll data of the old save;
 Fixed an issue where the player could not submit the third "Lost and Found" quest;
 Fixed a texture error on Ah Hui's souvenirs in the showroom;
 Fixed an issue where some items in the backpack were missing category tags and could only be found under "All Items".

